[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m Endless Stair                                                        Score: 0        Moves: 0      \u001b[10;1H\u001b(B\u001b[mAs in a dream, you see yourself tumbling down a great, dark staircase. All about you are shadowy\r\u001b[11d"]
[0.000, "o", "images of struggles against fierce opponents and diabolical traps. These give way to another round\r\u001b[12dof images: of imposing stone figures, a cool, clear lake, and, now, of an old, yet oddly youthful\r\u001b[13d"]
[0.000, "o", "man. He turns toward you slowly, his long, silver hair dancing about him in a fresh breeze. \"You\r\u001b[14dhave reached the final test, my friend! You are proved clever and powerful, but this is not yet\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "enough! Seek me when you feel yourself worthy!\" The dream dissolves around you as his last words\r\u001b[16d"]
[0.000, "o", "echo through the void....\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "ZORK III: The Dungeon Master\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "Infocom interactive fiction - a fantasy story\r\u001b[20dCopyright 1982, 1983, 1984, 1986 Infocom, Inc. All rights reserved.\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "ZORK is a registered trademark of Infocom, Inc.\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "Release 25 / Serial number 860811\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "Endless Stair\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "You are at the bottom of a seemingly endless stair, winding its way upward beyond your vision. An\r\u001b[26deerie light, coming from all around you, casts strange shadows on the walls. To the south is a dark\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "and winding trail.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "Your old friend, the brass lantern, is at your feet.\r\u001b[30d>"]
